/mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> only\".</p>\n</div></div>",
